INSERT INTO `quest_description_conditional` (`QuestId`, `PlayerConditionId`, `QuestgiverCreatureId`, `locale`, `Text`, `OrderIndex`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
(94933, 151288, 257544, 'enUS', 'Ah, you\'re there!\n\nOur esteemed Magister Umbric has tasked me with wrangling an able-bodied champion to assist him. An apprentice of his, Leona Darkstrider, is investigating the techniques and methods of the illidari.\n\nIt appears her inquiries may have put her in a bit of trouble.\n\nThe Magister can fill you in. He\'s in K\'aresh now, and he\'s allowed me to open the way for you if you require transportation.', 0, 65655), -- Lessons in the Void
(92630, 149795, 248153, 'enUS', 'My apprentice, Leona, has been preoccupied with a desire to learn the ways of the Illidari.\n\nShe has found another demon hunter willing to train her: Allari the Souleater. But first, Leona must prove herself worthy. After what happened when last she last sought such a mentor, I worry for her safety.\n\nJoin Leona for this trial. Make sure she is not getting involved in something she is not prepared to handle.', 0, 65655), -- The Pursuit Continues
(90765, 134204, 237504, 'enUS', 'Cult activity in the area has risen significantly. While we are gathering troops, you will secure a cultist disguise and infiltrate their training grounds nearby.\n\nFind out anything you can about the Twilight\'s Blade and their goals. I will maintain security here.\n\nDo not actually join the Twilight\'s Blade. If you do, be assured our forces here will end your Void dealings permanently.', 0, 65655), -- Midnight Dress
(90763, 134204, 246158, 'enUS', 'I\'ve received word from Magister Umbric. He has found similar evidence that the Twilight\'s Blade are recruiting in Stormwind.\n\nThe Void poses an existential threat to all of Azeroth, whether you realize that or not.\n\nThe cult gathers in the Twilight Highlands. Meet me and Magister Umbric there so we may continue our investigation.', 0, 65655), -- The Twilight Highlands
(90761, 134204, 246158, 'enUS', 'The Cult of Twilight has long been dedicated to ending Azeroth. That they ally with Xal\'atath is no surprise.\n\nIf the Twilight\'s Blade are indoctrinating citizens, we must stop them. Scour the Cleft of Shadows for cultists and end any you may find.\n\nThe cult\'s rhetoric may appeal to you. Save your fraternizing with the Void for after we have destroyed Xal\'atath and her Twilight\'s Blade.', 0, 65655), -- Avoiding Blame
(87308, 134204, 237504, 'enUS', 'The remnants of the Twilight\'s Hammer are reforming under a new banner, crawling from their holes to pledge allegiance to the Twilight\'s Blade and their new mistress: Xal\'atath.\n\nWe cannot allow this to occur. Stamp them out.\n\n<Rommath pauses, his eyes narrowing.>\n\nDo not think your taint has escaped me, $n, or that your participation counts for aught.\n\nYou may have everyone else fooled, perhaps even yourself, but there can be no coexistence, no understanding, with regards to the Void.\n\nA greater kindness would be to see you on the pyre beside them.', 0, 65655); -- Twilight's Dawn
